  skos:definition "A role borne by a person at a buyer that shapes how the buyer reaches its decision."@en ;
  skos:scopeNote "Buying roles are roles in a purchase decision, not personas (Baseline decisions 22 and 23): a persona instance may bear one in a given opportunity."@en ;
